  },
  {
    "id": 3006002010080,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "霧子もか……\r\nフフ、これはいったい何をしているんだい？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600201/3006002010080"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006002010090,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "三峰たち、今度ドラマのオーディション受けることに\r\nなったんだ。ねーきりりん！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600201/3006002010090"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006002010100,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "う、うん……\r\nえ……と、舞台が……女子校で……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kiriko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600201/3006002010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006002010110,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "そうそう。でも雰囲気全然わかんなくて、\r\n女子校ごっこ──もとい、練習しなきゃって思ったんだよ！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600201/3006002010110"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006002010120,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "なるほどね\r\nそれであの口調だったわけだ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600201/3006002010120"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006002010130,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "それは合点がいったけれど……\r\nどうして私は『お姉様』と呼ばれたのかな？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600201/3006002010130"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006002010140,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "さくやんの雰囲気って、\r\nまさに後輩に慕われるお姉様って感じだからさ",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600201/3006002010140"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006002010150,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "う、うん、咲耶さん……\r\nすごく綺麗で……頼もしくて……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kiriko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600201/3006002010150"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006002010160,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ。ありがとう霧子",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600201/3006002010160"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006002010170,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "さくやん相手に練習すれば、自然と妹の気持ちに\r\nなれるかな～と思ってさ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600201/3006002010170"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006002010180,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "結華が私の妹、か……\r\nフフ、でも結華は、私より年上じゃなかったかな？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600201/3006002010180"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006002010190,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "あ……そうだね……",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "kiriko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600201/3006002010190"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006002010200,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "あら、なんの話でしょう咲耶お姉様\r\n結華には少し難しいです……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600201/3006002010200"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006002010210,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ\r\nまあ、今は野暮なことを言うのはよそうか",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600201/3006002010210"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006002010220,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "さすがお姉様！\r\n話が早くていらっしゃいます！",
